duled for December 2027."},{"q":"How can I get the current price for Canny Aravindam?","a":"Pricing is available upon request based on configuration and unit floor. Contact Naani Projects on WhatsApp or call +91 94939 43946 for current price sheets and site visits."}]'::jsonb, ARRAY['/assets/canny-aravindam/canny-aravindam-elevation.jpg','/assets/canny-aravindam/canny-aravindam-clubhouse.jpg','/assets/canny-aravindam/canny-aravindam-brochure.png']::text[], '/assets/canny-aravindam/canny-aravindam-elevation.jpg', NULL, 'https://www.google.com/maps?q=Bowrampet+Hyderabad&output=embed', 'Canny Aravindam, Bowrampet | 2 & 3 BHK Flats', 'Explore Canny Aravindam in Bowrampet, Hyderabad. View 2 and 3 BHK apartment details, amenities, floor plans and RERA information.', 'https://www.naani.in/projects/canny-aravindam', '/projects/canny-aravindam', true, 'published', NULL, '2026-11-21T11:12:35.462Z', 'internal', '2026-11-21T11:12:35.464Z', '2026-11-21T11:12:35.464Z')
